====================================================================================================
D. Lemma 3 (carry lemma, q = 5): the orbit of y - 1 against the orbit of y under 5n+1
====================================================================================================
D1. for all 400001 integers y in [-2e5, 2e5] (the identities are polynomial, hence 2-adic): y=1 mod 4: 11 -> 00, T^2 y = 25 T^2(y-1) + 8 (next 3 parities agree); y=3 mod 4: 10 -> 01, T^2(y-1) = T^2 y - 1; y=2 mod 4: 01 -> 11, T^2(y-1) = 5 T^2 y - 7; y=0 mod 4: 00 -> 10, T^2(y-1) = 5 T^2 y - 1: OK
D2. sign of the exact gain g(s) matches the carry prediction (+ at a '11' stop, - at a '0x' stop) or g = 0 for 1633/2046 odd residues at k = 12 (EMPIRICAL: later disagreements can reverse the sign)

